    "detailed_description": "Surrounded by a dark void with no way of escape, a small village is all that's left, stranded.<br>Explore the surroundings of the beautiful but strange village, uncovering the mysteries of the Black Sea, all the while fighting monsters and bosses in your way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201500/extras/69b21d62911d10b60f3f694b61fb9b7c.poster.avif?t=1742154519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201500/extras/69b21d62911d10b60f3f694b61fb9b7c.webm?t=1742154519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201500/extras/69b21d62911d10b60f3f694b61fb9b7c.mp4?t=1742154519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Encounter unique monsters</strong><br>Fight off peculiar monsters of the surrounding environment.<br><br><strong>Expand your map</strong><br>While the village is small, it is still easy to get lost. Find landmarks to expand your map.<br><br><strong>Explore through different environments</strong><br>Seasons change over time, and new areas are traversable as the story progresses.<br><br><strong>Interact with NPC's</strong><br>Upgrade your equipment, or learn more about them.",
    "about_the_game": "Surrounded by a dark void with no way of escape, a small village is all that's left, stranded.<br>Explore the surroundings of the beautiful but strange village, uncovering the mysteries of the Black Sea, all the while fighting monsters and bosses in your way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201500/extras/69b21d62911d10b60f3f694b61fb9b7c.poster.avif?t=1742154519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201500/extras/69b21d62911d10b60f3f694b61fb9b7c.webm?t=1742154519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201500/extras/69b21d62911d10b60f3f694b61fb9b7c.mp4?t=1742154519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Encounter unique monsters</strong><br>Fight off peculiar monsters of the surrounding environment.<br><br><strong>Expand your map</strong><br>While the village is small, it is still easy to get lost. Find landmarks to expand your map.<br><br><strong>Explore through different environments</strong><br>Seasons change over time, and new areas are traversable as the story progresses.<br><br><strong>Interact with NPC's</strong><br>Upgrade your equipment, or learn more about them.",
